<title>ITALY: Italy April wholesale prices fall 0.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy April wholesale prices fall 0.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT</p>
<p>gave the following Italian wholesale price data for April.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	 April 97     March 97     April 96</p>
<p> Year/Year change	  -0.7 pct    +0.3 pct    +4.5 pct</p>
<p> Month/Month change	-0.4 pct    -0.2 pct    +0.7 pct</p>
<p> Index (base 1990 =100)  133.8	 134.3	 134.8</p>
</text>
